flowchart TD
    A[Requirements / Decisions] --> B[Owning A&D / SPEC contract]
    B --> C[Verification Case]
    C --> D[ReleaseAcceptanceProfile]
    D --> E[Exact ReleaseCandidate]
    E --> F[Execute on Matrix Cell]
    F --> G[VerificationResult]
    G --> H{Mandatory?}
    H -->|No| I[Observation / experimental evidence]
    H -->|Yes| J{PASS?}
    J -->|No| K[FAIL / BLOCKED]
    K --> L[Fix or remove support claim]
    L --> C
    J -->|Yes| M[Release Gate]
    M --> N{All mandatory gates PASS?}
    N -->|No| O[BLOCKED]
    N -->|Yes| P[ReleaseReadinessRecord]
    P --> Q[Required sign-offs]
    Q --> R[PRODUCTION_READY]
